# Used by BuildKit for packages/orchestrator/Dockerfile only (the repository root is the
# build context). Keeps host-built node_modules and compiled output out of the image, and
# keeps the context small: a repository-local pnpm store (.pnpm-store) is hundreds of MB and
# would otherwise be sent to the Docker daemon on every build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.pnpm-store
.git
.github
.vscode
phases
infra
scripts
docs
**/.DS_Store
**/._*
**/*.log